sequenceDiagram
    participant Browser
    participant NextJS as Next.js API
    participant GoProxy as Go Proxy Server
    participant LakehouseApp as Databricks Lakehouse App

    Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: User Initiates Code Editor Session

    Browser->>NextJS: Request code editor page
    NextJS->>NextJS: Fetch user's OAuth token from session
    NextJS->>NextJS: Encrypt token with AES-256-GCM
    NextJS->>NextJS: Generate proxy URL:<br/>/app-proxy/{encrypted}/{provider}/{domain}/{app}/
    NextJS->>Browser: Return HTML with iframe src=proxy URL

    Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: Iframe Loads Through Proxy

    Browser->>GoProxy: GET /app-proxy/{encrypted}/aws/databricksapps/{app}/
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Parse URL to extract encrypted token
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Decrypt token using shared encryption key
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Construct target URL:<br/>https://{app}.aws.databricksapps.com/
    GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: GET / with Authorization: Bearer {token}
    LakehouseApp->>LakehouseApp: Validate OAuth token
    LakehouseApp->>GoProxy: Return HTML/JS/CSS
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Add CORS headers
    GoProxy->>Browser: Forward response
    Browser->>Browser: Render app in iframe

    Note over Browser,LakehouseApp: WebSocket Connection for Real-time Features

    Browser->>GoProxy: WebSocket Upgrade Request
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Detect WebSocket upgrade
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Decrypt token from URL
    GoProxy->>GoProxy: Convert https:// to wss://
    GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: WebSocket Upgrade with Authorization header
    LakehouseApp->>GoProxy: WebSocket connection established
    GoProxy->>Browser: WebSocket connection established

    loop Bidirectional Communication
        Browser->>GoProxy: WebSocket message
        GoProxy->>LakehouseApp: Forward message
        LakehouseApp->>GoProxy: WebSocket message
        GoProxy->>Browser: Forward message
    end
